  "result": "Perfect! All 147 tests pass. I've successfully added the payment functionality:\n\n\u2705 **`src/payments.js`** with two functions:\n\n**`recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })`**\n- Records a payment on 'issued' or 'partially_paid' invoices\n- Validates amount is a positive integer (error: AMOUNT_INVALID)\n- Validates date is YYYY-MM-DD format (error: DATE_INVALID)\n- Rejects payments exceeding amount owed (error: OVERPAYMENT)\n- Creates invoice.payments array if missing\n- Updates invoice status automatically:\n  - 'paid' when payments cover the total\n  - 'partially_paid' when amount is still owed\n- Returns ok(newInvoice) with payment added\n- Never mutates the original invoice\n- Error: NOT_ISSUED for draft or already-paid invoices\n\n**`balanceDue(invoice)`**\n- Calculates amount still owed (total minus payments)\n- Returns 0 if invoice is paid or overpaid (clamped at 0)\n\n\u2705 **New error codes** in src/errors.js:\n- NOT_ISSUED: \"Invoice status must be 'issued' or 'partially_paid' to record a payment.\"\n- OVERPAYMENT: \"Payment is more than the amount owed.\"\n\n\u2705 **Comprehensive tests** covering:\n- Recording payments on issued invoices\n- Recording payments on partially_paid invoices\n- Status transitions (issued \u2192 partially_paid \u2192 paid)\n- All error conditions (wrong status, invalid amount, invalid date, overpayment)\n- Multiple payments accumulating correctly\n- Balance due calculations\n- No mutation of original invoices\n\nThe payment system is now complete and fully tested. Invoices can be issued, tracked through partial payments, and marked as paid.",
